        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Looks at all the uses of the given value Returns the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_dead_argument_elimination_pass_1a3dee2ca18ff5275c99041264099fd964" kindref="member">Liveness</ref> deduced from the uses of this value. </para>
